# Go Agentic dual-license path map / Go Agentic 双许可证路径映射

This `LICENSE` file is the authoritative, machine-verifiable directory-to-license map for the independent release.

本 `LICENSE` 文件是独立发行版的权威、机器可验证的路径与许可证映射。

